  "sourceCommit": "35577bd6824509b66728a3801c37177b22e83dcf",
  "html": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">MageOS_StoreLocator</h1><a id=\"user-content-mageos_storelocator\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: MageOS_StoreLocator\" href=\"#mageos_storelocator\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Store Locator for Mage-OS / Magento 2. Provides an admin-managed list of physical\nstores and a configurable storefront page that plots them on a map (Google Maps or\nOpenStreetMap), with text search and \"use my location\" geolocation.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Features</h2><a id=\"user-content-features\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Features\" href=\"#features\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><strong>Admin CRUD</strong> under <em>Stores → Store Locator → Manage Stores</em> (grid + form with\naddress, geo coordinates, per-day opening hours and store-view visibility).</li>\n<li><strong>System configuration</strong> under <em>Stores → Configuration → Store Locator</em>: map\nprovider, Google API key, default zoom, search radius, distance unit, geolocation\ntoggle, default opening hours and recurring holiday closing days.</li>\n<li><strong>Dual map provider</strong>: Google Maps (requires an API key) or Leaflet/OpenStreetMap\n(no key required). Selected in the configuration.</li>\n<li><strong>Hyvä frontend</strong> (<code>view/frontend/templates/index.phtml</code>): Tailwind + Alpine.js.\nMap-library specifics are isolated in <code>view/frontend/web/js/store-locator-map.js</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>Configurable URL</strong>: defaults to <code>/storelocator</code>; a custom slug set in the\nconfiguration is matched by <code>Controller/Router</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>REST API</strong> (<code>etc/webapi.xml</code>): search / get / save / delete, guarded by the\n<code>MageOS_StoreLocator::store</code> ACL resource.</li>\n<li><strong>CSP whitelist</strong> (<code>etc/csp_whitelist.xml</code>) for the external map domains.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Installation</h2><a id=\"user-content-installation\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Installation\" href=\"#installation\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The module lives in <code>app/code/MageOS/StoreLocator</code>. Enable and upgrade:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"bin/magento module:enable MageOS_StoreLocator\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\nbin/magento setup:di:compile        # production mode only\nbin/magento setup:static-content:deploy   # production mode only\nbin/magento cache:flush\"><pre>bin/magento module:enable MageOS_StoreLocator\nbin/magento setup:upgrade\nbin/magento setup:di:compile        <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> production mode only</span>\nbin/magento setup:static-content:deploy   <span class=\"pl-c\"><span class=\"pl-c\">#</span> production mode only</span>\nbin/magento cache:flush</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Installing the module does <strong>not</strong> create any store records. To populate a few\nexample stores for a demo (opt-in, safe to re-run — existing names are\nskipped):</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"bin/magento storelocator:demo:create\"><pre>bin/magento storelocator:demo:create</pre></div>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Configuration</h2><a id=\"user-content-configuration\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Configuration\" href=\"#configuration\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ol dir=\"auto\">\n<li><em>Stores → Configuration → Store Locator → General</em>: set <strong>Enabled = Yes</strong> and the\n<strong>URL Route</strong>.</li>\n<li><em>Map Settings</em>: pick the <strong>Map Provider</strong>. For Google Maps add the <strong>API Key</strong>\n(stored encrypted).</li>\n<li>Visit <code>/&lt;route&gt;</code> on the storefront (default <code>/storelocator</code>).</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Notes</h2><a id=\"user-content-notes\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Notes\" href=\"#notes\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>The Web API endpoints are all protected by the admin <code>MageOS_StoreLocator::store</code>\nresource. Loosen the GET routes to <code>anonymous</code> only if a public read API is wanted —\nnote that <code>getList</code> returns inactive stores too.</li>\n<li>Opening hours are stored as a JSON map (<code>{\"monday\":\"09:00-18:00\", ...}</code>) in the\n<code>opening_hours</code> column.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Tests</h2><a id=\"user-content-tests\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Tests\" href=\"#tests\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Unit tests live in <code>Test/Unit</code>. From the Magento root:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vendor/bin/phpunit -c dev/tests/unit/phpunit.xml.dist app/code/MageOS/StoreLocator/Test/Unit\"><pre>vendor/bin/phpunit -c dev/tests/unit/phpunit.xml.dist app/code/MageOS/StoreLocator/Test/Unit</pre></div>\n</article></div>"
}
